# The responsive sudo prompt (task 014 P3d) with a physical keyboard: APPLAUNCH_OSK=auto and one keyboard present, so
# the on-screen keyboard stays away and the dialog shows its Cancel / OK buttons. Typed password (masked), Enter
# (Authenticating..., OK dimmed), a wrong password (red line, field cleared, editing again), Esc closes it. Review only.
title sudo prompt keyboard
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 1
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
sudoprompt open
shot sudo_kbd_open
type hunter2
shot sudo_kbd_typed
key ENTER
shot sudo_kbd_busy
sudoprompt wrong
shot sudo_kbd_wrong
key ESC
wait 300
shot sudo_kbd_closed
